# Template for the JARVIS-dedicated Cannanas adapter credentials on lacasa-server.
# Copy to deploy/cannanas/cannanas-adapter.credentials and fill in fresh values;
# every field is a placeholder. File must be mode 0600, owned by the service user.
# NEVER copy the Hermes key: create a new least-privilege JARVIS key.
# The real file is gitignored (deploy/cannanas/*.credentials).
CANNANAS_API_KEY=SET-BY-OPERATOR
CANNANAS_CLUB_ID=SET-BY-OPERATOR
CANNANAS_STATE_DIR=SET-BY-OPERATOR
CANNANAS_AUDIT_FILE=SET-BY-OPERATOR